extension de $\unsure{\widehat{\mathcal T}_{0,3}|\widehat{\Gamma}_{0,3}}
\unsure{=|:}\unsure{\mathcal T_{0,3}|\Gamma_{0,3}}
=\mathfrak S_3\unsure{\times|\ast}\mathbb Z/2$
par $\widehat\pi$,
